          <div class="question"><b>Q3. Which is the smallest heading?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> &lt;h1&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> &lt;h6&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> &lt;h2&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> &lt;small&gt;</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. Which tag is used for a paragraph?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> &lt;para&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> &lt;p&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> &lt;text&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> &lt;pg&gt;</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. What does &lt;br&gt; do?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> Makes text bold</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> Breaks line / goes to new line</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> Adds image</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> Adds link</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. What does &lt;hr&gt; do?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> Makes horizontal line</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> Makes text red</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> Adds heading</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> Breaks page</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. Which tag has NO closing tag?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> &lt;p&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> &lt;h1&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> &lt;br&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> &lt;title&gt;</label></div>
